  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">India Freedom of Expression Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project effectively seeks to implement the UPR recommendations related to freedom of media and expression made in the Universal Periodic Review (UPR) India of November 2022 whose implementation will further be reviewed by the UN Human Rights Committee during the project period when it examines India&#x2019;s periodic report submitted on 22 September 2022 after a gap of two decades.</narrative>
  </description>
